('use_of_english_0275', 'Use of English', 'Stress', 'Word Stress', NULL, '[{"weight": 1, "conceptId": "stfgmb"}]'::jsonb, '{}', 2, 'recall', 60, 'low', 'none', '[{"option": "B", "explanation": "Suffer is stressed on the first syllable, so a student who mispronounces it might wrongly think its pattern differs from the others.", "misconceptionId": "memorized_not_understood"}, {"option": "C", "explanation": "As a compound noun, blackboard follows the common first-syllable stress rule, which some may not recognize as shared with the other words.", "misconceptionId": "misunderstood_terminology"}, {"option": "D", "explanation": "Calendar is stressed on the first syllable; a student unsure of the three-syllable pattern might mistakenly flag it as different.", "misconceptionId": "confused_similar_concepts"}]'::jsonb, '{}', 'jamb_past_question', 2002, 'JAMB', '{}', 'Choose the word that has a different stress pattern from the others.', '[{"label": "A", "text": "prevent", "isCorrect": true}, {"label": "B", "text": "suffer", "isCorrect": false}, {"label": "C", "text": "blackboard", "isCorrect": false}, {"label": "D", "text": "calendar", "isCorrect": false}]'::jsonb, 'A', '''Prevent'' is stressed on the second syllable (pre-VENT), while ''suffer'', ''blackboard'', and ''calendar'' are all stressed on the first syllable.', 'live', '{"totalAttempts": 0, "correctCount": 0, "avgResponseTimeMs": 0, "distractorSelectionCounts": {}}'::jsonb);